  "script": "(* E5CC status words: bit n of the high word is status bit 16 + n *)\nStopped := ((Status_Hi - (Status_Hi MOD 256)) / 256) MOD 2;\nManual := ((Status_Hi - (Status_Hi MOD 1024)) / 1024) MOD 2;\nAuto := 1 - Manual;\nAlarm1 := ((Status_Lo - (Status_Lo MOD 4096)) / 4096) MOD 2;\nInput_Error := ((Status_Lo - (Status_Lo MOD 64)) / 64) MOD 2;\n",
